    {
      "id": "long_section",
      "question": "List all core MVP features and all suggested additional features in Executive Summary.pdf.",
      "result": {
        "answer": "- Core / MVP features: AI-generated video lectures, topic-wise notes, quizzes, and question banks, supported by teacher and administrator interfaces [S1]. The narrative notes that core content generation and study tools are prioritized for the MVP [S4], and the comparison table categorizes AI Video Lessons, Topic Summaries/Notes, Dynamic Test Series, Q&A and Forum, and Performance Analytics under the MVP phase [S5].\n- Suggested additional features: Adaptive learning paths, student analytics dashboards, peer Q&A forums, and gamification elements [S1]. The suggested additional features section and comparison table also detail:\n - Adaptive Learning Paths [S2][S5]\n - Live Doubt-Solving Forum [S2][S5]\n - Progress Tracking & Analytics [S2][S5]\n - Gamification [S2][S5]\n - Multilingual Support (or Multilingual Content) [S2][S5]\n - Offline Access & Mobile App [S2][S5]",
